<doctext field_name="doctext">Let's start with some basics:
&lt;c&gt;
use warnings;
use strict;

open (my $file, '&gt;', "testendings")
   or die "unable to open testendings for write! $!";
   
   
print $file "test\n";
&lt;/c&gt;
The file testendings contains binary(ok, Hex)&lt;br&gt;
746573740D0A&lt;br&gt;
0D is CR and 0A is LF.&lt;p&gt;

Can you replicate this and agree with it on Windows?



